      "id": "factor-common-power",
      "title": "Factor out the common power",
      "explanation": "All three terms contain the factor \\(7^{2024}\\). Factoring it out gives\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n7^{2024}+7^{2025}+7^{2026}\n&=7^{2024}(1+7+7^2)\\\\\n&=7^{2024}(1+7+49)\\\\\n&=7^{2024}\\cdot57\\\\\n&=19\\bigl(3\\cdot7^{2024}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\nThe expression is an integer multiple of \\(19\\), so the remainder is \\(\\boxed{0}\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{A}\\).",
      "directNodeIds": [
        "cnm_151",
